# Witness: call(code := P): a named argument is not a single Structure, it is not opened; P itself runs, and the call writes seen after it (fable, R80)
# Norm: the book #declaration-selection (its table), #admission; the plan #two-kinds-of-receivers-plan item 1; R65-R68, R71, R76.
# Slice «selection of the declaration by the call» (plan #two-kinds-of-receivers-plan).
(
    Observed:
        int: seen 0
)
@: shared data[0]

sub: main (D(int: x 5); C(shared\Observed\seen := x); P(@: data D; @: code C))
    call(code := P)
    shared\Observed\seen := 9
main()
